| Scope and success metrics | `docs/prd.md` |
| How to work: gates, done, what needs the human | `.keelokit/harness/execution-protocol.md` |
| Rules and what enforces each | `.keelokit/harness/rules.toml` (house), `.keelokit/rules.local.toml` (this project) |
| Stack and why | `.keelokit/harness/stack.md`; deviations in `docs/decisions/` |
| What to build next | `backlog/` — run `pnpm doctor --brief` |

